// Tab-indicator colours, included AFTER noctalia.kdl on purpose.
//
// Three files set tab-indicator: colors.kdl (static), layout.kdl (sizing) and
// the generated noctalia.kdl. niri merges them per-property rather than
// letting the last whole block win -- the width set in layout.kdl survives
// even though noctalia.kdl declares a tab-indicator of its own without one --
// so the only way to beat a generated colour is to set it from a file included
// later. Editing noctalia.kdl directly would be undone by the next
// `noctalia msg templates-apply`.
//
// Why these values: the colour did not change, the area did. At the old 4 px
// the full-strength accent read as a hairline; at 12 px the same #a7c080 is
// three times the ink and shouts. Alpha trims the weight without giving up the
// Everforest identity, and the inactive tabs drop back to a near-background
// grey so only the focused one carries colour.
layout {
    tab-indicator {
        active-color   "#a7c080cc"
        inactive-color "#56635f66"
        urgent-color   "#e67e80cc"
    }
}
